Subject: [PATCH 3/3] docs(privacy): record the wall's states and what may take
 it down

Section 2.1 of the authority record now says what the entry notice does
when a visitor comes back to it, agrees somewhere else, or arrives with a
sign-in still being carried in (audit findings A3 and A4), where that is
tested, and that WebKit and iPad Safari are not covered by any automated
run.

